          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "action_5",
        "instruction": {
          "title": "Analogy: passing in a neighboring lane",
          "description": "Think of a car passing another vehicle moving more slowly. Relative to you, the other car can appear to drift backward. Earth\u2019s \u2018passing\u2019 relative to Mars produces the apparent retrograde loop."
        },
